    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy room decoration game you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you clean and decorate beautiful areas to your liking, you will help the town and the magical creatures that inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/aef3b14a1d43cced4a1335a814b73de6.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust colors, sizes and magical effects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/d89d984b16c04998c05d2ac086ccd443.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/2dda6bf4cfd171d11a073cae156f59bf.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the town's inhabitants  and learn more about them as you clean and decorate their shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/236b0d8dc0701fbe5ee63cc475d6d174.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Help magical creatures and give them love as you discover what is the cause of the mysterious corruption affecting them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/0537a8d220357b530c453709360f8555.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the rooms, furniture and hundreds of objects available for you to play with! Be creative and make any Magic Room you can dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c07f9f923bcd9a5bdf12fd92f6660c23.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span>\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help the town as you decorate multiple\u00a0areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Creative Mode - Create your own rooms with hundreds of objects at your fingertips.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks as you make each space your own by customising each room to your liking. <br>\ud83e\uddf8 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with lofi songs and customizable weather.  <br>\ud83e\uddff Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/5c47757785bc9ba4e7c731bcf5734c2e.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy room decoration game you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you clean and decorate beautiful areas to your liking, you will help the town and the magical creatures that inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/aef3b14a1d43cced4a1335a814b73de6.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ada2d9762bf4742556e8cbd243a105e.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust colors, sizes and magical effects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/d89d984b16c04998c05d2ac086ccd443.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/2dda6bf4cfd171d11a073cae156f59bf.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the town's inhabitants  and learn more about them as you clean and decorate their shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/236b0d8dc0701fbe5ee63cc475d6d174.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c2d7a2143bc698c4a011850b2a48cc7b.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Help magical creatures and give them love as you discover what is the cause of the mysterious corruption affecting them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/0537a8d220357b530c453709360f8555.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.poster.avif?t=1753740463\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.webm?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/592d0c94cbfa18f8552fb99eb8311478.mp4?t=1753740463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the rooms, furniture and hundreds of objects available for you to play with! Be creative and make any Magic Room you can dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/c07f9f923bcd9a5bdf12fd92f6660c23.avif?t=1753740463\" /></span>\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help the town as you decorate multiple\u00a0areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Creative Mode - Create your own rooms with hundreds of objects at your fingertips.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks as you make each space your own by customising each room to your liking. <br>\ud83e\uddf8 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with lofi songs and customizable weather.  <br>\ud83e\uddff Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers. </p>",
